      "id": "2b0c63059988-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If sin &theta; + cos &theta; = \\(\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{3}\\) , then the value of (cos &theta; &ndash; sin &theta;) is:",
      "questionHtml": "If sin &theta; + cos &theta;&nbsp;=<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{3}\\)</span> , then the value of (cos&nbsp;&theta;&nbsp; &ndash;&nbsp; sin &theta;) is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{7}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{7}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{5}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{5}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<sub><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{3}\\)</span></sub>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">On squaring both sides,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (sin θ + cos θ)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>  = (<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{11}}{3}\\)</span>)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ sin<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> θ + cos<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> θ + 2sin θcos θ  = 11/9</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 2sin θcos θ = 11/9 - 1 = 2/9</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">(<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">cos θ  –  sin θ</span>)<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> = sin<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> θ + cos<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> θ - 2sin θcos θ  </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">cos θ  –  sin θ</span>)<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2 </span> = 1 - 2/9 ⇒ (<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">cos θ  –  sin θ</span> ) = <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{3}\\)</span>  </p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
