      "question": "Simplify \\(\\rm \\frac{\\cos 13^{\\circ}+\\sin 13^{\\circ}}{\\cos 13^{\\circ}-\\sin 13^{\\circ}}\\)",
      "questionHtml": "Simplify&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{\\cos 13^{\\circ}+\\sin 13^{\\circ}}{\\cos 13^{\\circ}-\\sin 13^{\\circ}}\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "cot 58&deg;",
          "html": "cot 58&deg;&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "cos 26&deg;",
          "html": "cos 26&deg;&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "tan 32&deg;",
          "html": "tan 32&deg;&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "tan 58&deg;",
          "html": "tan 58&deg;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm \\frac{\\cos 13^{∘}+\\sin 13^{∘}}{\\cos 13^{∘}-\\sin 13^{∘}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Dividing numerator and denominator by cos13° </p>\n\n<p>⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1 +\\frac{sin13°}{cos13°}}{1 - \\frac{sin13°}{cos13°}}\\)</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{tan\\frac{\\pi}{4} + tan13°}{1 - tan\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\times tan13°}\\)</span>  ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(tan(45°+ 13°)\\)</span> ⇒<strong> </strong></span>tan 58° </p>\n",
