    {
      "id": "2b0c63059988-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If sec x + tan x = 5 and cosec y - cot y = \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\) , then find the value of (sec x + cosec y) - (tan x - cot y).",
      "questionHtml": "If sec x + tan x = 5 and cosec y - cot y =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span>, then find the value of (sec x + cosec y) - (tan x - cot y).",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4.2",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">4.2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2.2",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">2.2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3.1",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">3.1</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3.2",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">3.2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">sec x + tan x = 5 and cosec y&nbsp;- cot y&nbsp;=&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>sec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1</p>\n\n<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>&theta; - cot<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1</p>\n\n<p>a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= (a - b)(a + b)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">sec x + tan x = 5,</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">sec</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">x - tan</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">x = 1</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sec x + tan x)(sec x - tan x) = 1</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5 &times; (sec x - tan x) = 1</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (sec x - tan x) =&nbsp;<span style=\"\"><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1\\over5\\)</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Now, cosec y&nbsp;- cot y&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>cosec<sup>2</sup>y - cot<sup>2</sup>y = 1</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (cosec y + cot y)(cosec y - cot y) = 1</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (1/3) &times; (cosec y + cot y) = 1</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;cosec y&nbsp;+ cot y</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;3</p>\n\n<p>Again according to the question,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (<span style=\"\">sec x + cosec y) - (tan x&nbsp;- cot y)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr; sec x + cosec y&nbsp;- tan x +&nbsp;cot y</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; sec x <span style=\"\">-&nbsp;tan x&nbsp;</span>+ cosec y&nbsp;+&nbsp;cot y</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;+ 3 =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(16\\over5\\)</span>&nbsp;= 3.2</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; The value of (sec x + cosec y) - (tan x - cot y) is 3.2</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2b0c63059988-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "\\(\\sin ^{2} \\theta+\\frac{1}{1+\\tan ^{2} \\theta}=\\cdots\\)",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin ^{2} \\theta+\\frac{1}{1+\\tan ^{2} \\theta}=\\cdots\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "None of these",
          "html": "None of these"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin^2 \\theta + \\frac{1}{1 + \\tan^2 \\theta}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>1. <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin^2 \\theta + \\cos^2 \\theta = 1\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>2. <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(1 + \\tan^2 \\theta = sec^2 \\theta\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>3.&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{sec^2\\theta} = cos^2\\theta\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculations:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin^2 \\theta + \\frac{1}{1 + \\tan^2 \\theta}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin^2 \\theta + \\frac{1}{sec^2 \\theta}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sin^2 \\theta + cos^2\\theta\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1</p>\n\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal;  line-height: normal; \"><strong><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; \">&there4;</span> Option 1 is the correct answer.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2b0c63059988-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If sin &alpha; + cos &alpha; = \\(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}\\) , then what is (tan &alpha; + cot &alpha;) equal to?",
      "questionHtml": "If sin &alpha; + cos&nbsp;&alpha; =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt3}\\)</span>, then what is (tan&nbsp;&alpha; + cot&nbsp;&alpha;) equal to?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">sin α + cos α = </span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{√3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ sin<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> α + cos<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span> α + 2sin α.cos α = (2/√3)<sup>2</sup> ⇒  1 + 2sin α.cos α = 4/3 ⇒ 2sin α.cos α = 4/3 - 1 = 1/3 ⇒ sin α.cos α = 1/6</span></p>\n\n<p>tan α + cot α = (<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">sin α/cos α) + (cos α/sin α)  = (sin</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> α + cos</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> α )/(sin</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> α.cos</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> α) = 1/(sin α.cos</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> α) = 6</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2b0c63059988-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "If cosec &theta; - sin &theta; = a 3 , sec &theta; - cos &theta; = b 3 , then a 2 b 2 (a 2 + b 2 ) is equal to",
      "questionHtml": "If cosec&nbsp;&theta; - sin&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&theta; = a<sup>3</sup>, sec&nbsp;&theta; - cos&nbsp;&theta; = b<sup>3</sup>, then a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>) is equal to</span>&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-2",
          "html": "-2"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">cosec&nbsp;&theta; - sin&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&theta; = a<span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">sec&nbsp;&theta; - cos&nbsp;&theta; = b<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Formula Used:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">cosec&theta;&nbsp;= 1/sin&theta;</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"\">sec&theta; = 1/cos&theta;</span></li>\n\t<li>sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; +&nbsp;cos<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1</li>\n\t<li>(a<sup>m</sup>)<sup>n</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>mn</sup></li>\n\t<li>a<sup>m</sup>a<sup>n</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>m+n</sup></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b>Calculation:&nbsp;</b></p>\n\n<p>Given that,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">cosec&nbsp;&theta; - sin&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">&theta; = a<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 1/sin&theta; - sin&theta; = a<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (1 - sin<sup>2</sup>&theta;)/sin&theta; = a<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (cos</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&theta;)/sin&theta; = a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; <strong>[cos<sup>2</sup>&theta;/sin&nbsp;&theta;]<sup>1</sup><sup>/3</sup>&nbsp;= a&nbsp;</strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; ----(1)</p>\n\n<p>Also, we have&nbsp;<span style=\"\">sec&nbsp;&theta; - cos&nbsp;&theta; = b<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 1/cos&nbsp;&theta; - cos&theta; = b<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; (1 - cos<sup>2</sup>&theta;)/cos&theta; = b<sup>3</sup></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; <strong>[sin<sup>2</sup>&theta;/cos &theta;]<sup>1</sup><sup>/3</sup>&nbsp;= b&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong> &nbsp; -----(2)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Now, the value of a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;(a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">) </span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Using equation (1) &amp; (2)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\([\\frac{cos^2θ}{sin\\ θ}]^{2/3}[\\frac{sin^2θ}{cos\\ θ}]^{2/3}[(\\frac{cos^2θ}{sin\\ θ})^{2/3}+(\\frac{sin^2θ}{cos\\ θ})^{2/3}]\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\([\\frac{cos^2θ}{sin\\ θ}\\times \\frac{sin^2θ}{cos\\ θ}]^{2/3}[(\\frac{cos^{4/3}θ}{sin^{2/3}\\ θ})+(\\frac{sin^{4/3}θ}{cos^{2/3}\\ θ})^{}]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; cos<sup>2/3</sup>&theta; sin<sup>2/3</sup>&theta;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\([\\frac{cos^{2}θ+sin^{2}θ}{sin^{2/3}θ cos^{2/3}θ}]\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; sin<sup>2</sup>&theta; + cos<sup>2</sup>&theta; = 1</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;(a<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ b<span style=\"line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>) = 1</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is 1&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
