      "number": 9,
      "question": "Using the measurements given in the following figure, the value of \\( \\frac{\\sin \\phi+\\tan \\theta}{\\sin \\phi−\\tan \\theta}\\) is ________.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Using the measurements given in the following figure, the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(  \\frac{\\sin \\phi+\\tan \\theta}{\\sin \\phi−\\tan \\theta}\\)</span> is ________.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/11/F2_Madhuri_SSC_25.11.2022_D3.png\" style=\"width: 204px; height: 203px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(−\\frac{7}{32}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(−\\frac{7}{32}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{7}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{7}{3}\\)</span>"
