    {
      "id": "2b0c63059988-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "\\(\\frac{sin(90^\\circ-x)cosec(90^\\circ-x)}{1+tan^2(90^\\circ-x)}\\) ?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{sin(90^\\circ-x)cosec(90^\\circ-x)}{1+tan^2(90^\\circ-x)}\\)</span>&nbsp;?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "sin 2 x",
          "html": "sin<sup>2</sup>x&nbsp;"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "cos 2 x",
          "html": "cos<sup>2</sup>x"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "tan 2 x",
          "html": "tan<sup>2</sup>x"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "cosec 2 x",
          "html": "cosec<sup>2</sup>x"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>sin (90 -&nbsp;&theta;)&nbsp;=&nbsp; cos&nbsp;&theta;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>tan (90 - &theta;) = cot &theta;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>cosec (90 -&nbsp;&theta;) = sec&nbsp;&theta;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">sec</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;- 1 = <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">tan</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&theta;&nbsp;&rArr;&nbsp;</span>1 + tan<sup>2</sup>&theta; = sec<sup>2</sup>&theta;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1/(cosec &theta;) = sin&nbsp;&theta;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{sin(90^\\circ-x)cosec(90^\\circ-x)}{1+tan^2(90^\\circ-x)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>By using the above formula&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/(1 + cot<sup>2</sup>x)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>1/cosec<sup>2</sup>x</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>sin<sup>2</sup>x</p>\n\n<p>&there4;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{sin(90^\\circ-x)cosec(90^\\circ-x)}{1+tan^2(90^\\circ-x)}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">sin</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">x</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    }
  ],
